  m_text: '-To start building you need to have a project loaded.

    -To create
    a project press the + button at top left corner.

    -Once a project is loaded
    you can create shapes and joints.

    -Press the play button on top to run the
    simulation.

    -You should create shapes first then add joints to connect them.

    -Once
    done, you can save your work by exporting to a file using

    the export button
    at top left panel.

    -You can import your saved file using the import button
    at top left panel.


    Limitations:


    -Creating very small or very large
    objects.

    -Rope joint is unstable with very large/small objects.

    -Removing
    objects with connected joints is unstable.

    -Moving and Rotating objects
    with attached joints is unsupported.



'
